{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 61,
  "name": "风泽中孚",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08375",
              "text": "中孚：豚鱼吉，利涉大川，利贞。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08375",
                "bodyParagraph": 8311
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08376",
              "text": "【白话】《中孚卦》象征诚信：诚信施及到愚钝无知的小猪小鱼身上，从而感化了它们，因此获得吉祥，利于涉越大河大川，利于坚守中正之道。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08376",
                "bodyParagraph": 8312
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08377",
              "text": "《象》曰：“泽上有风，中孚；君子以议狱缓死。”",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08377",
                "bodyParagraph": 8313
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08378",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说《中孚卦》的卦象是兑（泽）下巽（风）上，为泽上有风，风吹动着泽水之表象，比喻没有诚信之德施及不到的地方，说明极为诚信；君子应当效法“中孚”之象，广施信德，慎重地议论刑法讼狱，宽缓死刑。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08378",
                "bodyParagraph": 8314
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08380",
              "text": "中孚卦巽上兑下，泽上有风、风起波动，象征由内而外的感应与诚信。“孚”有信实之义，卦辞“豚鱼，吉；利涉大川，利贞”表明祭品虽薄，只要真诚也可吉祥。《象》说“君子以议狱缓死”，强调处理诉讼刑罚更要慎重宽厚。事业和经商都以诚实守信为本，但诚信并非不辨是非、盲目轻信。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08380",
                "bodyParagraph": 8316
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08383",
              "text": "初九，虞吉，有它不燕。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08383",
                "bodyParagraph": 8319
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08384",
              "text": "【白话】初九，能安守诚信，可以获得吉祥，如果另有他求的话就会得不到安宁。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08384",
                "bodyParagraph": 8320
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08385",
              "text": "《象》曰：初九“虞吉”，志未变也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08385",
                "bodyParagraph": 8321
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08386",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：《中孚卦》的第一爻位（初九）“能安守诚信，可以获得吉祥”，是因为其没有他求的志向没有改变。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08386",
                "bodyParagraph": 8322
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08388",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08388",
                "bodyParagraph": 8324
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08390",
              "text": "初九爻动，变为第59卦《涣卦》（风水涣）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08390",
                "bodyParagraph": 8326
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08392",
              "text": "初九“虞吉，有它不燕”，事先审慎而心志专一则安宁；心怀他求或任意改变主意，易失稳妥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08392",
                "bodyParagraph": 8328
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "九二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08395",
              "text": "九二，鸣鹤在陰，其子和之；我有好爵，吾与尔靡之。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08395",
                "bodyParagraph": 8331
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08396",
              "text": "【白话】九二，鹤在山的北面鸣叫，它的那些同类们一声声地应和着它；我有醇香的酒浆，愿与你一同畅饮。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08396",
                "bodyParagraph": 8332
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08397",
              "text": "《象》曰：其子和之，中心愿也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08397",
                "bodyParagraph": 8333
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08398",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“鹤的那些同类们一声声地应和着它”，说明它们表露出了内心的意愿。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08398",
                "bodyParagraph": 8334
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08400",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08400",
                "bodyParagraph": 8336
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08402",
              "text": "九二爻动，变为第42卦《益卦》（风雷益）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08402",
                "bodyParagraph": 8338
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08404",
              "text": "九二“鸣鹤在阴，其子和之；我有好爵，吾与尔靡之”，鹤鸣互应、共饮美酒象征真诚可以跨越距离，引起共鸣并促进分享合作。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08404",
                "bodyParagraph": 8340
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "六三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08407",
              "text": "六三，得敌，或鼓或罢，或泣或歌。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08407",
                "bodyParagraph": 8343
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08408",
              "text": "【白话】六三，面临强劲的敌人，或者敲起战鼓发动进攻，或者兵疲将乏而致败退，或因为惧怕敌人的反击而哭泣，或由于敌人不加侵害而高兴地歌唱。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08408",
                "bodyParagraph": 8344
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08409",
              "text": "《象》曰：“或鼓或罢”，位不当也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08409",
                "bodyParagraph": 8345
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08410",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“或者敲起战鼓发动进攻，或者兵疲将乏而致败退”，均是因为六三爻居位不正的缘故。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08410",
                "bodyParagraph": 8346
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08412",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08412",
                "bodyParagraph": 8348
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08414",
              "text": "六三爻动，变为第9卦《小畜卦》（风天小畜）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08414",
                "bodyParagraph": 8350
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08416",
              "text": "六三“得敌，或鼓或罢，或泣或歌”，感情和行动随外物起落，说明诚信不足、立场未定时易陷反复。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08416",
                "bodyParagraph": 8352
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "六四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08419",
              "text": "六四，月几望，马匹亡，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08419",
                "bodyParagraph": 8355
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08420",
              "text": "【白话】六四，月亮将圆而未盈，好马失掉了匹配，不会有什么祸害。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08420",
                "bodyParagraph": 8356
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08421",
              "text": "《象》曰：“马匹亡”，绝类上也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08421",
                "bodyParagraph": 8357
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08422",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“好马失掉了匹配”，是指六四爻诚信专一，断绝与同类之间的交往，而专心事奉君主。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08422",
                "bodyParagraph": 8358
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08424",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08424",
                "bodyParagraph": 8360
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08426",
              "text": "六四爻动，变为第10卦《履卦》（天泽履）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08426",
                "bodyParagraph": 8362
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08428",
              "text": "六四“月几望，马匹亡，无咎”，临近圆满之时要懂得取舍，离开不适当的同类羁绊而专心守正。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08428",
                "bodyParagraph": 8364
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "九五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08431",
              "text": "九五，有孚挛如，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08431",
                "bodyParagraph": 8367
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08432",
              "text": "【白话】九五，具有诚信之德并以其牵系天下人心，天下的人也以诚信相和应，所以没有祸患。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08432",
                "bodyParagraph": 8368
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08433",
              "text": "《象》曰：“有孚挛如”，位正当也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08433",
                "bodyParagraph": 8369
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08434",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“具有诚信之德并以其牵系天下人心”，是指居位中正适当，说明中心诚信这种教化作用可以施及整个邦国。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08434",
                "bodyParagraph": 8370
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08436",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08436",
                "bodyParagraph": 8372
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08438",
              "text": "九五爻动，变为第41卦《损卦》（山泽损）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08438",
                "bodyParagraph": 8374
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08440",
              "text": "九五“有孚挛如，无咎”，诚信把上下人心紧密联结；居中得正的领导能以信任维系团体。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08440",
                "bodyParagraph": 8376
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08443",
              "text": "上九，翰音登于天，贞凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08443",
                "bodyParagraph": 8379
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08444",
              "text": "【白话】上九，鸟高飞着，鸣叫声响彻天空，有可能出现凶险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08444",
                "bodyParagraph": 8380
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08445",
              "text": "《象》曰：“翰音登于天”，何可长也！",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08445",
                "bodyParagraph": 8381
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-08446",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“鸟高飞着，鸣叫声响彻天空”，这种声音虚而不实，声高于情，怎么可能长久保持呢？",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08446",
                "bodyParagraph": 8382
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08448",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08448",
                "bodyParagraph": 8384
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08450",
              "text": "上九爻动，变为第60卦《节卦》（水泽节）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08450",
                "bodyParagraph": 8386
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-08452",
              "text": "上九“翰音登于天，贞凶”，只有声音而无实力的飞鸡难以久居天空。徒有名声、虚张声势，终难持久。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-08452",
                "bodyParagraph": 8388
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
